    description: "Repro: _extract_config_embedding on a 32-manifest fixture under PYTHONHASHSEED 0/1/2 -> three different output digests and file sets. The heuristic path sorts (sketch.py ~1253); the embedding path does not. Same defect class as WI-vosag (PR #1509), whose fix missed this path. Fix: sort every set/frozenset/glob iteration feeding the candidate list; add a seed-varying determinism test that exercises the cap.\n\nFound by the 2026-10-10 docstring-staleness audit (reviewer + default-REJECT verifier, reproduced). Notebook: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_10102026.md."  # 9123
